:: Felix Ask About Classmate Lucas [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 1>>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Felix",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Felix Quest Mateo")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> what he thinks about <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He is the blonde boy? He is a little funny, no?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Seemed very shy when I tried to talk to him before.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<<elseif !$CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: Punishment Game")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> what he thinks about <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He is a little funny, no? Like funny strange.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But that is not bad, I think. He seems very nice, but nervous. I try talking to him a few times, but he always mixes words up and gets embarrassed.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> what he thinks about <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He is your friend, yes? He is a little funny, though this is not bad.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You should helping me talk to him sometime. I tried before, but he got words all mixed up and became red and embarrassed. But I would love to get to know of him.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>

