<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Felix Quest Mateo")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> what he thinks about <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> and he shrugs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He seems…”</span> He pauses for a long moment, trying to think of the proper word or phrase. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Like he is up a stick? Like… hmm… Thinks himself very big. You understand?”</span> You laugh, catching his meaning. <br>
